  "name": "Client Intake",
  "description": "Onboard a new client before kickoff: contacts, project scope, goals, timeline, budget range, stakeholders and brand files.",
  "category": "Business",
  "seoTitle": "Free Client Intake Form Template for Agencies",
  "seoDescription": "Client intake form template that gathers contacts, project scope, goals, deadlines, budget range, decision makers and files. Start every kickoff fully briefed.",
